{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45588","headline":"古意九首 九 · 贯休","name":"古意九首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆在山中时，丹桂花葳蕤。\n红泉浸瑶草，白日生华滋。\n箬屋开地鑪，翠墙挂藤衣。\n看经竹窗边，白猨三两枝。\n东峰有老人，眼碧头骨奇。\n种薤煮白石，旨趣如婴儿。\n月上来打门，月落方始归。\n授我微妙诀，恬澹无所爲。\n别来六七年，只恐白日飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}